'''Lanturn ex''' (Japanese: '''ランターンex''' ''Lantern ex'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

